title: ConstructionWorker
---
Construction Worker: Hello kid, nice day today.
Construction Worker: You want a cigarette?
-> Yeah!
    Construction Worker: Good for you kid.
-> Hell nah!
    Construction Worker: Terrible!
-> Who are you?
    Construction Worker: I'm someone who's addicted to cigarettes.
-> Are you my dad?
    Construction Worker: Obviously, I left for the milk.
===
